 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "When is the deploy freeze for billing-api, and why?\n[2025-11-11] standup/atlas/2025-11-11: Deploy freeze for the billing API: 2025-11-24 to 2025-12-02 (the peak season). [2025-09-30] standup/atlas/2025-09-30: Decision: billing-api will gate the new invoice flow behind feature-flags, because the rollout needs a per-tenant kill switch. The billing API now depends on the feature flag service. The Atlas team planning meeting is every Tuesday. [2025-04-02] standup/ember/2025-04-02: Changes to the billing API need a rollback plan attached to the pull request.",
  "dimensions": 1536
 },
